; Banner Addresses
;
; Pointers to the 8x8 bitmaps in #R$0000 and #R$0798 that spell
; "Speech System © CURRAH 1983", used by #R$01AB. A high byte of #N$FF
; ends the list.
@label=BannerAddresses
w$075B DEFW $07A0    ; #R$0798(#N$07A0) ("S").
 $075D DEFW $07A8    ; #R$0798(#N$07A8) ("p").
 $075F DEFW $07B0    ; #R$0798(#N$07B0) ("e").
